WEBVTT

00:07:28.496 --> 00:07:30.246
that, had Abed not injured me,

00:07:30.246 --> 00:07:33.371
I would now, in all
likelihood, be a doctor

00:07:33.413 --> 00:07:35.996
and a husband and a father.

00:07:36.871 --> 00:07:39.454
I would be less mindful
of time and of death,

00:07:39.454 --> 00:07:41.204
and, oh, I would not be disabled,

00:07:41.246 --> 00:07:44.538
would not suffer the thousand
slings and arrows of my fortune.

00:07:44.579 --> 00:07:47.663
The frequent furl of five fingers,
the chips in my teeth

00:07:47.663 --> 00:07:51.788
come from biting at all the many things
a solitary hand cannot open.

00:07:52.579 --> 00:07:56.288
The dancer and the dance
were hopelessly entwined.

00:07:57.954 --> 00:08:00.996
It was approaching 11
when I exited right toward Afula,